give @s written_book[written_book_content={title:"Juggernaut Instructions",author:"BubkisLord",generation:1,pages:[\
{"text":"Juggernaut\n\nOne or more Juggernauts hunt a team of Runners. Runners must replenish stations before they are wiped out. Juggernaut wins by eliminating all Runners. Runners win by completing enough stations."},\
{"text":"Setup\n\nPlayers are picked as Juggernaut(s) randomly. All other players are Runners. Runners have 25s to prep and find a station before the Juggernaut spawns at one of the 3 farthest spawn points from the Runners' spawn"},\
{"text":"Lives\n\nEach Runner starts with (Juggernaut count + 1) lives. When all lives are lost, Runners may spectate the game. The Juggernaut has 1 life - its death grants Runners an instant win."},\
{"text":"Replenishment Stations\n\n These are found around the map. Be within 3 blocks of a station to replenish (some may be on only one floor of a building). If the Juggernaut is within 12 blocks of a station, it cannot be replenished"},\
{"text":"Station Particles\n\nTotem = Station present\nPurple = Warning: Juggernaut nearby\nEnd Rod = being replenished\nFlame / White Smoke = blocked from replenishment (e.g. by a Glyph)"},\
{"text":"The Chase\n\nRunners near a Juggernaut can (and usually) enter chase. While being chased the top station is passively replenished. No replenishment from chase is received when the Juggernaut is sneaking."},\
{"text":"Healing\n\nStand still (not sneaking) while a hurt ally crouches near you to heal them. Sneak alone to slowly self-heal. The more health lost, the longer it takes to heal."},\
{"text":"Runner Kits\n\nGuide - faster replenishment\nEscapist - evasive\nRogue - stealthy\nMedic - rapid healing\nScout - spots Juggernaut, mobility\nSurvivor - extra life, tanky"},\
{"text":"More Runner Kits\n\nGhost - Invisible\nEngineer - portable stations\nTrickster - disorients Juggernaut"},\
{"text":"Juggernaut Kits\n\nClassic - one-shot crit axe\nDragon - ranged breath, flight\nHunter - mark prey, ranged\nWarlock - area lockdown glyphs\nPredator - permanent stealth"},\
{"text":"More Juggernaut Kits\n\nSpirit Walker - short teleport\nWitch Doctor - stacking buffs\nTimekeeper - damage tracks\nChameleon - disguises as Runners\nFishmonger - trident mobility\nKnight - horse & jousting spear"},\
{"text":"Tips to Win\n\nRunners: rotate stations, do not group up, break line of sight with terrain.\nJuggernaut: control chokepoints, track recently-replenished stations, deny healing windows."},\
{"text":"Reset\n\nIf anything breaks, run /function minecraft:reset to fix the game state by resetting the game."}\
]}]